# Optional list of independently executed Docker modules, relative to
# vigilia/specifications/. Empty by default: the full CI profile already
# executes the entire knowledge base and must not repeat these tests.
#
# For isolated investigations, add one pathname per line in a temporary list
# and set VIGILIA_DOCKER_MODULES_FILE, or invoke ci/docker-suite.sh --module.
# Manual CI jobs accept VIGILIA_DOCKER_MODULES (comma-separated paths).
